# Scenario authoring notes (the detailed reference solution + injection recipe)
# stay harness-internal — like a benchmark's answer key. The published package
# ships the neutral trigger, the oracle spec, and solution/fix.patch.
**/scenarios/*/solution/reference-fix.md
**/scenarios/*/inject/README.md
